<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ shares close stronger, defy global trend.</title>
<headline>NZ shares close stronger, defy global trend.</headline>
<text>
<p>* NZ share market defied weakness in U.S. and Australia</p>
<p>* Turnover light, as has been all week</p>
<p>* Warehouse shoots ahead after surprise result</p>
